        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A. Excessive absenteeism and/or tardiness will result in a CAUTIONARY WARNING, WRITTEN WARNING. Continued poor attendance will result in a FINAL WARNING and thereafter, possible discharge.",
            "block_bbox": [
                344,
                201,
                1459,
                264
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    344.0,
                    201.0
                ],
                [
                    1459.0,
                    201.0
                ],
                [
                    1459.0,
                    264.0
                ],
                [
                    344.0,
                    264.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "B. 1. An employee has a combination of attendance and/or punctuality problems which exceed six (6) points in any rolling 3-month period or ten (10) points in a rolling 12-month period. Each absence will count as one (1) point. Each long lunch shall count as a ½ point or 1 full point. Each tardy and employee-initiated home-early over 15 minutes will count as a full point. Tardiest under 15 minutes but greater than five (5) will be recorded as 1/2 point.",
            "block_bbox": [
                346,
                287,
                1481,
                435
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    346.0,
                    287.0
                ],
                [
                    1481.0,
                    287.0
                ],
                [
                    1481.0,
                    435.0
                ],
                [
                    346.0,
                    435.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "C. An employee who shows a clearly identifiable pattern in his/her absences and/or punctuality (e.g. Fridays, excessive short-term tardiest or Saturdays, long lunches, day off after vacation, etc.) shall receive counseling.",
            "block_bbox": [
                347,
